<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>飞行日志与数传</title>
<style>body{margin:0;background:#0a1521;color:#dbeaf6;font:15px system-ui}main{max-width:1250px;margin:auto;padding:22px}a{color:#74e0dd}section{background:#132333;border:1px solid #294356;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;margin:16px 0}button,select,input{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:#20384a;border:1px solid #426379;border-radius:5px;padding:7px;margin:4px}button{cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.5}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}td,th{border-bottom:1px solid #294356;padding:8px;text-align:left}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word;max-height:300px;overflow:auto}.muted{color:#9aafc0}.warn{color:#ffd17c}.error{color:#ff9595}canvas{width:100%;height:290px;background:#0b1927;border:1px solid #2c485b}#seek{width:70%}.flex{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}h1{font-size:25px}h2{font-size:19px}.scroll{overflow:auto}</style></head>
<body><main><a href="/">← 返回原实时监控</a><h1>SiK 数传 · 飞行日志</h1><p class="muted">后台自动保存，关闭本页面不会停止记录。回放独立于实时显示。日志是地面接收记录，失联期间未收到的数据无法恢复。</p>
<section><h2>只读接收与自动记录</h2><div class="flex"><label>来源<select id="source"><option>SiK</option><option>USB</option></select></label><label>串口<select id="port"></select></label><label>速率<select id="baud"><option>115200</option><option>57600</option></select></label><button id="connect">切换接收源</button><button id="ports">刷新端口</button></div><p id="current">加载中</p><p class="muted">切换将关闭原端口、保存原会话并自动建立新会话；已解锁时禁止切换。此处不发送AT命令、遥控命令或校准命令。</p><input id="mark" placeholder="手工事件，如：更换4S电池" maxlength="500"><button id="add-mark">保存事件标记</button><span id="message" role="status"></span></section>
<section><h2>日志会话 <button id="refresh">刷新列表</button></h2><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>会话 / 来源</th><th>记录状态</th><th>大小</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody id="sessions"></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="viewer" hidden><h2 id="title">日志回放分析</h2><p class="warn">历史回放，不是实时飞机状态。PWM为指令/调度值；高度为FPGA融合/几何选通值，不能等同传感器分辨率或融合器内部状态。</p><div class="flex"><label>曲线<select id="field"></select></label><label>起始秒<input type="number" id="start" value="0" min="0" step=".1" style="width:95px"></label><label>结束秒<input type="number" id="end" step=".1" style="width:95px" placeholder="全部"></label><button id="range">分析区间</button><button id="report">下载分析JSON</button></div><canvas id="plot"></canvas><div class="flex"><button id="play">播放</button><input type="range" id="seek" min="0" max="1000" value="0"><span id="time"></span></div><pre id="sample"></pre><h2>区间摘要</h2><pre id="summary"></pre><h2>事件时间线</h2><p class="muted">首次连接读到的保留故障会标为retained，而非刚发生。source_event机上时间与接收时间分别保存；断流不能直接判为断电。</p><div id="events"></div></section>
</main><script src="/logs.js"></script></body></html>
